.tmp
testdata
# Checked-in test data is an exception to the broad testdata ignore: the
# conformance fixtures and the etl-output fixtures the discover/index tests read.
# Without these, a regenerated or added partition would be silently dropped from
# git status and ship missing from the diff.
!testdata/
!testdata/fixtures/
!testdata/fixtures/**
!testdata/etl-output/
!testdata/etl-output/**

# Guard against the doubled-path artifact a generator/test writes when run with
# its cwd set to testdata/ instead of the package dir (resolves testdata/etl-output
# to testdata/testdata/etl-output). Never a real fixture; keep it out of git.
testdata/testdata/